B.caj=new A.hg("Marketplace role","ProSME is a marketplace that helps customers and artisans discover, message, negotiate, and record service requests. ProSME is not a party to private work agreements unless a separate written contract says otherwise.")
B.cal=new A.hg("User responsibilities","Users must provide accurate account information, post lawful requests, avoid abusive or misleading content, and use the platform only for legitimate service activity.")
B.caq=new A.hg("Artisan responsibilities","Artisans must describe skills, prices, availability, credentials, bids, and completion status honestly. Artisans are responsible for permits, taxes, safety practices, and work quality required for their services.")
B.cae=new A.hg("Verification and trust","Verification badges show that submitted documents passed a platform review at the time of review. Verification is not a guarantee of identity, licensing, insurance, work quality, safety, or future conduct.")
B.ca6=new A.hg("Payments and disputes","Customers and artisans are responsible for agreeing payment terms, receipts, refunds, site visits, materials, timelines, and completion details. ProSME may provide records to help review a dispute but does not guarantee payment or outcomes.")
B.caa=new A.hg("Safety and prohibited conduct","Do not post illegal services, harassment, threats, fraud, stolen materials, dangerous work requests, spam, or content that violates another person's rights. Meet in safe locations and verify details before sharing money or sensitive information.")
B.caf=new A.hg("Chats, reports, and blocking","Chats are provided to help users discuss service requests. Users may report or block conversations that appear unsafe, abusive, fraudulent, or inappropriate. Reports may be reviewed by ProSME admins or support staff and may include message context, account IDs, timestamps, and related request records.")
B.cap=new A.hg("Account actions","ProSME may remove content, hide requests, limit features, reject verification, suspend accounts, or delete accounts when activity appears unsafe, fraudulent, unlawful, or harmful to the marketplace.")
B.cad=new A.hg("Admin and support review","Admin Dashboard tools may be used to review reports, account roles, verification status, listings, jobs, bids, notifications, and marketplace activity for support, safety, debugging, and abuse prevention.")
B.cab=new A.hg("Platform availability","The app may be updated, interrupted, delayed, or unavailable because of maintenance, network issues, third-party services, or security controls. ProSME is provided without a guarantee of uninterrupted access.")
B.can=new A.hg("Offline and cached data","The app may temporarily store account, listing, job, and chat data on your device to improve speed and offline access. Cached data updates when connectivity returns and may be removed by signing out, clearing app data, or deleting the account.")
B.cao=new A.hg("Liability limits","To the fullest extent allowed by law, ProSME is not responsible for indirect losses, lost profits, failed negotiations, off-platform payments, user conduct, or service quality. Users remain responsible for their own decisions and agreements.")
B.cak=new A.hg("Changes","These terms may be updated as the platform changes. Continued use of ProSME after updates means you accept the updated terms.")
B.bGT=s([B.caj,B.cal,B.caq,B.cae,B.ca6,B.caa,B.caf,B.cap,B.cad,B.cab,B.can,B.cao,B.cak],t.HP)
B.ca3=new A.Wz("Terms of Service",B.bGT)
B.ca7=new A.hg("Data we collect","ProSME stores account details, contact information, listings, jobs, chats, verification documents, saved listings, reports, blocked-chat records, and payment preferences needed to operate the marketplace.")
B.cac=new A.hg("How data is used","Data is used for authentication, service matching, artisan verification, safety review, support, notifications, dispute context, abuse prevention, and transaction records.")
B.cam=new A.hg("User rights","Users may update profile details, request account deletion, block chats, report unsafe activity, and contact support about data access or correction.")
B.cai=new A.hg("Third parties","The app uses secure cloud services for authentication, database, storage, realtime updates, and server functions. Payment, email, SMS, and map providers may process data when those features are used.")
