B.ca8=new A.hg("Authentication","Accounts are protected through secure authentication with email verification, password recovery, and OAuth providers when configured.")
B.cag=new A.hg("Access controls","Database access rules restrict private data and limit verification, report, and admin review tools to authorized accounts.")
B.ca9=new A.hg("Verification documents","Artisan ID files are limited to PDF or image files up to 1 MB and are stored in secure document storage.")
B.cah=new A.hg("Incident response","Report suspicious behavior or security concerns through Support or the chat report menu so the team can review accounts and platform activity.")
